                <h1 class="h3 mb-2">What is a Web Application?</h1>
                <p class="soft mb-2">
                    A <b>web application</b> is software hosted on a <b>server</b> and used through a <b>browser</b>.
                    Users interact using a URL—login, forms, dashboards, reports, payments—without installing the app on each device.
                </p>
                <p class="soft mb-0">
                    In real projects, the server handles security, data validation, business rules, and database/API integration—then sends the result back to the browser.
                </p>

